// A capture plan (`dev_capture::plan::CapturePlan`), the game's environment destruction (game
// state only): the wood preview the owner judges. Beside the house the wall cue takes (the one
// nearest the map's centre), the offline root stands two shipped trunk constructions, dev only and
// never in the shipped map: `preview_fir_intact`, left whole, and `preview_fir_broken`, whose foot
// a bare charge bursts against. Two rounds then strike the house's east roof slope square to it,
// aimed in the house's own frame (an aim that names no instance): one inside a board
// (`east/board_5`'s centre) and one across the nailed seam between `east/board_5` and
// `east/board_6`. The preview's camera stands east of the house looking at the slope, a trunk to
// either side. From the checkout root:
//
//   OVERMATCH_UNATTENDED=1 OVERMATCH_WINDOW=offscreen \
//     OVERMATCH_CAPTURE=scripts/capture/wood-preview.ron target/debug/overmatch --offline
//
// writes target/capture/wood-preview-<second>.png at each frame second, then exits. Aim points
// are house_1 asset metres read from its bake (board 5's section corners (0.8, 3.475),
// (0.83, 3.515), (0.96, 3.355), (0.99, 3.395); the seam is its lower edge, shared with board 6);
// the slope's outward normal is (0.6, 0.8, 0). Offsets, camera, times, the charge's mass and the
// rounds are capture configuration (ASSUMED), chosen to frame the break, never to reach an outcome.
(
    frames: (
        out: "target/capture/wood-preview.png",
        at: [7.0, 9.5, 11.5, 13.5, 18.0],
        size: (2560, 1440),
        ui: false,
        gizmos: false,
    ),
    wall: (
        shots: [
            Charge(kg: 2.0, core: "88mm_burst_core", at: 8.0, aim: (
                instance: "preview_fir_broken",
                at: (0.21, 0.0, 0.0),
                toward: (-1.0, 0.0, 0.0),
            )),
            Round(round: "88mm_AP", at: 10.0, aim: (
                at: (0.895, 3.435, -1.5),
                toward: (-0.6, -0.8, 0.0),
            )),
            Round(round: "88mm_AP", at: 12.0, aim: (
                at: (0.975, 3.375, 1.5),
                toward: (-0.6, -0.8, 0.0),
            )),
        ],
        preview: (
            place: [
                (asset: "fir_1", id: "preview_fir_intact", offset: (4.0, -9.0), yaw_deg: 0.0),
                (asset: "fir_1", id: "preview_fir_broken", offset: (4.0, 9.0), yaw_deg: 0.0),
            ],
            eye: (24.0, 8.0, 0.0),
            look: (3.0, 5.0, 0.0),
        ),
    ),
)
